ilure..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/536?cb=20210116014638 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Fear of failure.\" width=\"270\" height=\"152\" data-image-key=\"Fear_of_failure..png\" data-image-name=\"Fear of failure..png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"series\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Series</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Series_2\" title=\"Series 2\">2</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"episode\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Episode</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"winner\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Winner</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Richard_Osman\" title=\"Richard Osman\">Richard Osman</a></div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Episode Guide</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\">← Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\">Next →</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_last_supper.\" title=\"The last supper.\">The last supper.</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\"><a href=\"/wiki/Pork_is_a_sausage.\" title=\"Pork is a sausage.\">Pork is a sausage.</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><i><b>Fear of failure.</b></i> is the first episode of <a href=\"/wiki/Series_2\" title=\"Series 2\">Series 2</a> of <i>Taskmaster</i> and was first broadcast on <a href=\"/wiki/Dave\" title=\"Dave\">Dave</a> on 21 June 2016. The episode was won by <a href=\"/wiki/Richard_Osman\" title=\"Richard Osman\">Richard Osman</a>. \n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Episode_title\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode title</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Alternate_titles\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Alternate titles</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Episode_breakdown\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode breakdown</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#External_links\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">External links</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_title\">Episode title</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode title\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Fear_of_failure.?veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode title\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>\"Fear of failure\" was what <a href=\"/wiki/Fred_the_Swede\" title=\"Fred the Swede\">Fred the Swede</a> disclosed to be his greatest fear, during the <a href=\"/wiki/Find_out_the_following_information_from_this_Swedish_person\" title=\"Find out the following information from this Swedish person\">Find out the following information from this Swedish person</a> task. The title card shows the potato on the pavement contestants used for the <a href=\"/wiki/Get_this_potato_into_the_golf_hole\" title=\"Get this potato into the golf hole\">Get this potato into the golf hole</a> task.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Alternate_titles\">Alternate titles</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Fear_of_failure.?veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li>On Denmark's TV2 Play streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Frygt for fiasko', which translates as 'Fear of failure'.</li>\n<li>On Finland's MTV Katsomo streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Epäonnistumisen pelko', which translates as 'Fear of failure'.</li>\n<li>On Norway's Discovery+ Norge streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Frykt for å mislykkes', which translates as 'Fear of failure'. Note: this Norwegian translation of the title only appears in the subtitles for the episode, whereas the episode title listed on the platform is the original English title.<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_breakdown\">Episode breakdown</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Fear_of_failure.?veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mbox\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;wrapper\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;header\">Spoilers!</div><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;text mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-spoilers\">This section contains spoilers.</div><span class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;close mw-customtoggle-spoilers\" title=\"Dismiss\"></span></div></div></div>\n<table class=\"tmtable\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"tmtableheader\">\n<th>Task\n</th>\n<th>Description\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Doc_Brown\" title=\"Doc Brown\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Doc Brown</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Joe_Wilkinson\" title=\"Joe Wilkinson\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Joe Wilkinson</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Jon_Richardson\" title=\"Jon Richardson\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Jon Richardson</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Katherine_Ryan\" title=\"Katherine Ryan\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Katherine Ryan</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Richard_Osman\" title=\"Richard Osman\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Richard Osman</span></a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Most_important_document\" title=\"Most important document\">1</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Prize:</b> Most important document.\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Place_these_three_exercise_balls_on_the_yoga_mat_on_the_top_of_that_hill\" title=\"Place these three exercise balls on the yoga mat on the top of that hill\">2</a>\n</td>\n<td>Place these three exercise balls on the yoga mat on the top of that hill. The task is complete when all three balls sit fully inflated and stationary on the mat.\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Get_this_potato_into_the_golf_hole\" title=\"Get this potato into the golf hole\">3</a>\n</td>\n<td>Get this potato into the golf hole. You may not touch the red green.\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>DQ\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Find_out_the_following_information_from_this_Swedish_person\" title=\"Find out the following information from this Swedish person\">4</a>\n</td>\n<td>Find out the following information from this <a href=\"/wiki/Fred_the_Swede\" title=\"Fred the Swede\">Swedish person</a>. The Swedish person may not speak or write in English.\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Pack_for_your_holiday\" title=\"Pack for your holiday\">5</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Live:</b> Pack for your holiday. All items must either be packed in your hand luggage or worn on your body.\n</td>\n<td>0\n</td>\n<td>0\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtabletotal\">\n<th colspan=\"2\">Total\n</th>\n<td>9\n</td>\n<td>8\n</td>\n<td>18\n</td>\n<td>17\n</td>\n<td class=\"tmtablewinner\">20\n<